msgstr "Local-first software is an approach where your data primarily lives on your device, not on a remote server. The application works offline by default, treats the local copy as the source of truth, and synchronizes with other devices or users when connectivity is available."

#: src/app/[lang]/blog/local-first-movement-developers/page.tsx:597
